# Renders docs/treemap.gif. Run from the repository root: vhs docs/treemap.tape

Output docs/treemap.gif
Source docs/demo-setup.tape

Type@1ms "$SH"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Overview/
Type "3"
Show
Sleep 2s
Type "+"
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 800ms
Left
Sleep 800ms
Up
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2.2s
Backspace
Sleep 1.4s
Backspace
Sleep 1.4s
Type "-"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "-"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "+"
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Type "q"
